(1) Amineptine (7-[(10,11-dihydro-5H-dibenzo[a,d]cyclohepten-5-yl)amino]heptanoic acid);

(2) Aminorex;

(3) Cathinone;

(4) 4,4'-dimethylaminorex (common name: 4,4'-DMAR);

